---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import LaunchRoster from '../../components/LaunchRoster.astro';
import { locales, languageTag, origin } from '../../lib/publication.mjs';
const alternates = [...locales.map(locale => ({ lang: languageTag[locale], href: `${origin}/${locale}/characters/` })), { lang: 'x-default', href: `${origin}/zh-hans/characters/` }];
---
<Base locale="en" title="Azur Promilia Characters: China Launch Roster & Japan Names" description="Check China’s 20 standard-banner characters by rarity, first limited-banner context and Japan’s official preview names. Original regional names and sources included." alternates={alternates}>
  <div class="container">
    <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/en/">Home</a><span>/</span>Characters</nav>
    <header class="page-heading"><p class="eyebrow">OFFICIAL CHARACTER REFERENCES</p><h1>Azur Promilia characters</h1><p>Browse China’s launch standard pool by rarity, then compare the original names used on regional official pages.</p></header>
    <LaunchRoster locale="en"/>
    <section class="prose character-next" data-pagefind-body><h2>What this character list can tell you</h2><p>The standard-pool list records China’s November 26 official disclosure. The Japan list reproduces homepage preview names, while a separate China preview table preserves previously checked element and role labels. Names stay in their original regional scripts so you can identify the official page; no unverified English character names or Japan–China name mappings are introduced.</p><p>This is not a tier list. Complete skills, materials, equipment choices and tested teams are not available here yet. A five-star display or a preview position does not establish which character is best for your account.</p><h2>Before choosing an account or spending</h2><p>Check the <a href="/en/guides/getting-started/">first-session account checklist</a> and <a href="/en/guides/resources/">launch reward conditions</a>. Use the <a href="/en/guides/banner-rules/">regional banner guide</a> for Japan’s separately checked guarantees. China banner numbers do not become Japan rules when translated into English.</p><p>More source-dated character summaries are available in <a href="/ja/characters/" lang="ja">日本語</a> and <a href="/zh-hans/characters/" lang="zh-Hans">简体中文</a>. For short account and reward answers, use the <a href="/en/faq/">English FAQ</a>.</p></section>
  </div>
</Base>
<style>.character-next { max-width: 850px; padding-bottom: 4rem; }</style>
